## 3. Deliberate break in the subject (sabotage test)

Target: `novacore/src/novacore/llm.py` in `_complete_via_stdin`.
Mutation in subject: Added an intentional temp leak on the stdin completion path:
```python
        import tempfile
        (Path(tempfile.gettempdir()) / "leaked_prompt.txt").write_bytes(prompt_bytes)
```

