Finding: The unit test `test_no_prompt_leak_to_system_temp_via_stdin` misses the leak because its internal scanner limits directory inspection to `files[:20]` (`novacore/tests/test_llm_privacy.py:159`), while `tempfile.gettempdir()` contains over 10,000 files.

